  "tip": "A checkpoint mixes everything from Units 1–3. There are no new words: show what you know.\n\n- The verb follows the person: আমি **আছি**, তুমি **আছো**, আপনি **আছেন**, সে **আছে**, তুই **আছিস**.\n- **কি** asks yes/no; **কী** means \"what\".\n- **নই / নও / নন / নয়** = is not (something); **নেই** = is not there, don't have.\n- Father's side: **চাচা, ফুফু, দাদা**. Mother's side: **মামা, খালা, নানা**.",
